Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.32,1:54:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.56,1:54:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.32,1:54:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}高潮了 高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.04,1:55:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.08,1:57:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要射了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.56,1:57:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可以的 射吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.80,1:57:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}今为没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.88,1:57:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}射到里面吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.64,1:57:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}射多点吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.56,1:58:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服
